 ins and ends at Student Recreation Center\n\nWhat to bring:\n\nMoney for 
 spending\nComfortable shoes for walking\n\nPotential Hazards: Poisonous p
 lants/allergies\, insect bites\, unpredictable weather changes\, sunburn/
 heat exhaustion\, dehydration\, and injuries\, including sprains/strains\
 , abrasions\, lacerations and fractures.\n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\
 n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.c
 om/engage/event/12517518
