DESCRIPTION:Catch the excitement live as the New York Giants take on the A
 rizona Cardinals on October 4th at 1:00 PM! Join fellow students for an u
 nforgettable afternoon of NFL action\, school spirit\, and game-day energ
 y. No need to worry about transportation — bus service will be provided f
 rom the Montclair State Rec Center\, making it easy to get to and from th
 e game. The bus will depart at 11:30am. Don’t miss this opportunity to ex
 perience the thrill of live professional football alongside your friends 
 and classmates!\n \nHow do I sign up?\n\n$85 for students\;\nRegister her
 e\, or in the Student Rec Center main office\, or over the phone (973-655
 -3340).\nTickets go on sale for students on Wednesday\, August 26\, 2026\
 n\nWhere and when?\n\nSunday\, October 04\, 2026\n\n1:00 p.m game start\;
  11:30 a.m bus leaves from SRC\n\n\nMetLife Stadium\, East Rutherford\, N
 J\n\nMeet at Student Recreation Center (SRC) Lounge\n\n\nHosted by: Campu
 s Recreation\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair
 .campuslabs.com/engage/event/12826148
