DESCRIPTION:Join the Gamma Iota Chapter of Iota Phi Theta Fraternity\, Inc
 . for a Random PowerPoint Night! Students will have the opportunity to cr
 eate and present short PowerPoints on any fun\, creative\, or completely 
 random topic of their choice. Topics can range from funny debates and unp
 opular opinions to pop culture\, everyday life\, campus experiences\, and
  more. Presentations are meant to be lighthearted\, entertaining\, and in
 teractive. Even if you don't want to present\, come out\, watch the prese
 ntations\, react\, debate\, laugh\, and connect with other students. The 
 goal of this event is to create a fun and welcoming environment where stu
 dents can express their creativity\, meet new people\, and engage with th
 e campus community.\n\nHosted by: Iota Phi Theta Fraternity Inc.\n\nAddit
 ional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engag
 e/event/12838237
