BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:ThoughtfulLearning
CATEGORIES:Well-Being
CATEGORIES:Drop By
CATEGORIES:Civics
DESCRIPTION:Start your day with coffee and conversation! Join the Office o
 f Student Belonging and Civic and Voter Engagement for Espresso Your Vote
 \, a welcoming pop-up event on the Bloomfield College campus designed to 
 help you prepare for the upcoming election.\nWhether you need to register
  to vote\, update your voter registration\, check your registration statu
 s\, or simply have questions about the voting process\, our team is here 
 to help. We'll provide trusted\, nonpartisan information and resources to
  ensure you have everything you need to vote with confidence.\nEnjoy a co
 mplimentary cup of coffee while connecting with fellow students\, learnin
 g about important election dates and deadlines\, and discovering the many
  ways you can make your voice heard. Whether you're a first-time voter or
  a seasoned participant\, this is a great opportunity to get election-rea
 dy in a relaxed and welcoming environment.\nStop by to:\n\nRegister to vo
 te or update your voter registration\nVerify your voter registration stat
 us\nLearn about your voting options\nAsk questions about the upcoming ele
 ction\nGrab a complimentary cup of coffee and connect with campus resourc
 es\n\nSometimes the best conversations happen over coffee. Take a break b
 etween classes\, enjoy a fresh cup\, and leave feeling informed\, prepare
 d\, and ready to participate in our democracy. We look forward to welcomi
 ng the Bloomfield College community for a morning of conversation\, conne
 ction\, and civic engagement.\n\nHosted by: Civic & Voter Engagement\, Ca
 mpus Activities at Bloomfield\, First Generation Initiatives\, Office of 
 Student Belonging\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://mont
 clair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12540140
DTEND:20261007T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20261003T050250Z
DTSTART:20261007T160000Z
LOCATION:Bloomfield Campus: Deacon's Den
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Espresso Your Vote Grab a Coffee. Get Election Ready. (Bloomfield 
 Campus)
UID:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12540140
URL:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12540140
X-HOSTS:Office of Student Belonging
END:VEVENT
