 fessional wardrobe essentials\, do’s and don’ts\, and easy ways to elevat
 e your everyday look. Make the viral office siren office appropriate!\nFr
 om business casual to interview-ready\, we’ll show you how to put togethe
 r looks that are polished\, confident\, and still feel like you. Plus\, e
 njoy music\, snacks\, and a runway-style showcase where you can show off 
 your own professional style.\nCome get inspired\, find your workwear vibe
 \, and take your style from campus to office. Don't forget to bring a fri
 end or two \;)\n\nHosted by: Feliciano Women in Business\n\nAdditional In
 formation can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/
 12770473
