BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:Arts
CATEGORIES:Social
DESCRIPTION:The show is at 7 pm on October 7th and is about 2 hours and 30
  minutes long\, with one 15-minute intermission. Transportation will be p
 rovided and the bus will pick up from the Red Hawk Deck at 5 pm. Attendee
 s are encouraged to arrive at the Red Hawk Deck at 4:45 pm. The bus will 
 leave promptly at the conclusion of the show and aims to be back to campu
 s by 10:15 pm\, depending on traffic. Please direct all questions to acti
 vities@montclair.edu\nWhen Michael moves to California with his younger b
 rother Sam and their mother Lucy\, he’s desperate to leave his old life b
 ehind and start fresh. A wild night out on the boardwalk finds him in the
  shadows of Santa Carla and brings him face-to-face with David\, the magn
 etic leader of a local rock band. David and his bandmates offer Michael f
 reedom\, adventure\, and the connection he’s been longing to find. But wh
 en the band’s dark secret finally comes out\, Michael must decide how far
  he’s willing to go to belong.\nRegistration opens Mon\, Sep 14 2026 at 1
 0:00 AM until Thu\, Oct 8 2026 at 12:00 AM\n\n- Price: $25 for Montclair 
 Students\n- Seats are limited \n- Link for registration: https://rec.mont
 clair.edu/Program/GetProgramDetails?courseId=d02c08d2-c1ee-408e-adc8-39a2
 675d829f\n\n\nHosted by: Campus Activities\n\nAdditional Information can 
 be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12550498
DTEND:20261008T021500Z
