DESCRIPTION:Take a break\, recharge\, and discover resources that can help
  you feel your best and succeed at Montclair! Stop by our interactive wel
 lness fair to explore campus resources\, try fun activities\, pick up som
 e goodies\, and learn simple ways to support your mental health\, well-be
 ing\, and academic success. The more you explore\, the more chances you h
 ave to win prizes! Visit different tables\, participate in activities\, a
 nd collect your chances to win. Whether you’re looking to de-stress\, con
 nect with support\, or just have a little fun between classes\, there’s s
 omething for you! Come bee well\, bee supported\, and bee ready to excel!
 \n\nHosted by: Advocacy and Outreach\, Campus Recreation\, Campus Activit
 ies\, CAPS (Counseling and Psychological Services)\, Center for Academic 
 Success & Tutoring\, Center for Writing Excellence\, EATS by Gourmet Dini
 ng\, Office of Health Promotion\, Office of Commuter Life\, Residence Lif
 e\, Student Government Association\, Inc.\, Student Health Center\, Sprag
 ue Library\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.c
 ampuslabs.com/engage/event/12808085
