 cago on Broadway. We’ll head to New York City for a live performance of C
 hicago on Broadway. The show brings music\, dance\, and storytelling toge
 ther in one of the most iconic theater productions on stage. Chicago is a
  long-running Broadway musical set in a world of crime\, fame\, and perfo
 rmance. The cast delivers high-energy numbers and sharp choreography thro
 ughout the show. Bring comfortable shoes\, a good attitude\, and get read
 y for a night in the city.\nHow do I sign-up?\n\nRegister online through 
