 ne (973-655-3340).\nCost for Students: $45\n\nWhere and when?\n\nThursday
 \, October 8\, 2026\nArrive before 5 PM pickup\; show starts at 7 PM\nMee
 t at Student Recreation Center\nEvent held at: Ambassador Theatre\, 219 W
 est 49th Street\, New York\, NY\, 10019 \n\n\nHosted by: Campus Recreatio
 n\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs
 .com/engage/event/12656712
