  participating student organizations\, this formal event features dinner\
 , music\, entertainment\, dancing\, and a masquerade-themed atmosphere th
 at encourages students to connect and celebrate in an inclusive setting. 
 Proceeds from the event will benefit a designated charitable organization
 \, allowing attendees to enjoy a memorable evening while giving back to t
 he community. Through collaboration and philanthropy\, this event aims to
  foster unity\, cultural appreciation\, and service across Montclair Stat
 e University. Everyone is welcome.\n\nHosted by: Bangladesh Student Assoc
