DESCRIPTION:RAIN CHECK! WE ARE NOW SCHEDULED FOR 10/10/2026!Join us for th
 e Festival de los Andes on Saturday\, October 10\, from 2:00–7:00 p.m. at
  the Amphitheater! Celebrate the rich cultures and traditions of the Ande
 an countries through an afternoon of live music\, traditional dance\, art
 ists and artisans\, interactive workshops\, raffle and prizes\, food\, an
 d ALPACAS! This vibrant cultural festival brings together the Montclair S
 tate University community\, families\, Indigenous groups\, artists\, and 
 local communities to experience the music\, art\, traditions\, and creati
 vity of the Andes. Free and open to the public.\nPLEASE RSVP!https://docs
 .google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYjzC1n8bs1PV9Dcp4JWimXkTbklJQBbIBgo74ZVci2
 HhfLw/viewform\n\nHosted by: Association of Latino Professionals For Amer
 ica\, Bloomfield Beta Kappa Sigma Sorority\, Black and Latina Sorority In
 c.\, Bloomfield Lambda Sigma Upsilon Latino Fraternity\, Inc.\, Center fo
 r Latino Heritage & Spanish Language Excellence\, Dominican Student Organ
 ization\, Latin American Student Organization\, Latin@ Caucus\, Mexican-A
 merican Student Association\, Office for Hispanic Initiatives\, Puerto Ri
 can Student Organization\, Peruvian-American Student Organization\, Spani
 sh and Latino Studies\, The Latino Medical Student Association PLUS\n\nAd
 ditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/en
 gage/event/12626394
