DESCRIPTION:Montclair A Cappella is a vocal group where students are encou
 raged to show off their talents at a competitive level. We cover all aspe
 cts of what is necessary to provide stunning live or recorded performance
 s. As an A Cappella group\, we focus on vocal arrangements in order to pe
 rform in the ICCA's\, BOSS\, musical festivals\, and more. We also aim to
  perform at on-campus events and host of few concerts of our own. In orde
 r to participate in the vocal group\, there is an audition process. Howev
 er\, ALL students are welcome to be involved in making arrangements\, cho
 reography\, and audio/video production. Montclair A Cappella strives to b
 e a community of music-loving individuals with a drive for professionalis
 m and performance etiquette that stretches beyond the stage lights.\nJoin
  us for our bake sale! Come out and support us by buying treats!\n\nHoste
 d by: Montclair A Cappella\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: htt
 ps://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12832008
