DESCRIPTION:Becker is a global leader in professional education\, speciali
 zing in exam preparation for accounting and finance credentials. The comp
 any is most famous for its comprehensive CPA Exam Review course\, which u
 tilizes adaptive learning technology to prepare candidates for the curren
 t exam format. Beyond the CPA\, Becker offers preparation programs for ot
 her certifications\, including the CMA\, CIA\, and EA designations. For l
 icensed professionals\, they provide a massive catalog of continuing prof
 essional education courses to satisfy annual state board requirements. St
 udents and professionals can choose from various flexible study formats\,
  including self-study packages\, live online webcasts\, and interactive p
 odcasts.\n\nHosted by: Accounting Society\n\nAdditional Information can b
 e found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12807377
