DESCRIPTION:\nJoin us for the grand finale of NJ Law School Day!\n\n\n\nAf
 ter learning what it takes to get into law school\, stick around to conne
 ct directly with professionals who are doing the work.\nThis interactive 
 session breaks away from traditional panels to give you direct access to 
 public service professionals\, legal practitioners\, community advocates\
 , legislative staff\, policy experts\, and elected officials.\nThrough fa
 st-paced\, small-group rotating conversations\, you’ll discover real-worl
 d career paths\, and get honest insights into public interest work. Come 
 listen\, ask questions\, grab a snack\, and make connections that can kic
 kstart your legal or public service career.\n\n\n\n\nQuestions?  Contact 
 Donna Robertson at chsscareer@montclair.edu.\n\nHosted by: Civic & Voter 
 Engagement\, Government Relations and Community Affairs \, Pre-Law Progra
 m\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs
 .com/engage/event/12563273
DTEND:20261014T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20261003T050250Z
DTSTART:20261014T193000Z
