DESCRIPTION:Join us to visit Bowman's Hill Wildflower Preserve and explore
  over 130 acres of beautiful native plants\, peaceful woodland trails\, a
 nd scenic outdoor views perfect for a relaxing day in nature. Optional ad
 d on: The New Hope Railroad (starting at $35) for a charming rail ride th
 rough the Pennsylvania countryside or explore the town of New Hope. Ticke
 ts for the railroad are not covered by Outdoor Adventure\, and must be pu
 rchased on your own.\n \nHow do I sign-up?\n\nRegister here or in the Stu
 dent Rec Center main office\, or over the phone (973-655-3340).\nCost for
