BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:Social
DESCRIPTION:What is a Man? is a real and open dialogue centered on the sti
 gmatization of men and the expectations placed on masculinity. This space
  explores how societal pressures often force men to suppress emotion\, st
 ruggle in silence\, and avoid vulnerability. Through honest conversation\
 , we aim to break down those barriers and address men’s mental health in 
 a meaningful way. It’s a judgment-free environment that encourages reflec
 tion\, healing\, and connection\, reminding everyone that redefining stre
 ngth starts with being able to speak\, feel\, and be heard.\n\nHosted by:
  Lambda Sigma Upsilon Latino Fraternity\, Inc.\n\nAdditional Information 
 can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12792978
DTEND:20261020T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20261003T050250Z
DTSTART:20261020T003000Z
