DESCRIPTION:Pre-Law Society's newest sub-committee: 'Pre'-Law Review! \nA 
 new student-run journal that aims to give Montclair State University stud
 ents the opportunity to explore current and historical legal issues throu
 gh legal research\, writing\, and analysis. Members will work collaborati
 vely to research cases\, statutes\, and scholarly sources\, develop legal
  arguments\, and contribute to articles and commentary that may be publis
 hed in the Pre-Law Review.\nNo prior legal experience is required and stu
 dents of ALL majors/minors are encouraged to join! \n\nHosted by: Pre-Law
  Society\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.cam
 puslabs.com/engage/event/12846451
