BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:Athletics
DESCRIPTION:The big 3 lifts (Deadlift\, Squat\, and Bench Press) are the f
 oundation of true strength\, and now it is your time to dominate the plat
 form. Whether you’re lifting for the glory\, the prizes\, or just to beat
  your PR this is your chance to push your limits and have fun\, all while
  getting to utilize our brand new strength equipment!\n \n\nHow are resul
 ts scored?\n\nMaximum 5 repetitions\n1 attempt per lift after a warm-up s
 et\nScoring calculation: Weight lifted x repetitions divided by body weig
 ht\nFinal score will be total of 3 lifts combined\n\n\n \nHow do I sign u
 p?\n\nRegistration is not required\nFREE for students with a valid Montcl
 air State ID\n\nWhere and When?\n\nMonday\, October 26\, 2026\n2:00 p.m. 
 -5:00 p.m.\nStudent Recreation Center\, Plae Room\n\n Prizes: All entrant
 s will receive raffle tickets for\n\n\nGruper Yoga Mat Non-slip (x4 winne
 rs)\nKatamu Divine Wings Strength Kit\nTheragun WaveRoller\nAdidas Defend
 er Duffel Bags (x2 winners)\nNinja Creami 7-in-1\nBasketball\, Soccer bal
 l\, Football\n\n\n \n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdditional Informa
 tion can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12802
 101
