DESCRIPTION:Think success in college and beyond is all about technical kno
 w-how? Think again! This interactive workshop uncovers the real power of 
 soft skills—like communication\, teamwork\, problem-solving\, conflict re
 solution\, adaptability\, and discipline—that employers and professors al
 ike value most. Through hands-on activities and real-world examples\, you
 ’ll learn how to recognize\, strengthen\, and showcase these essential sk
 ills to thrive as a student and future professional.This workshop is pres
 ented by The Discovery Program. To contact the Discovery Program\, email 
 us at discoveryprogram@montclair.edu\, or visit us at montclair.edu/disco
 very-program.\n\nHosted by: The Discovery Program\n\nAdditional Informati
 on can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/1249477
 5
