DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a night of spooky fun\, friendly competition\, a
 nd exciting prizes at Spooky Bingo! Join us from 6:00 PM – 9:00 PM in the
  SRC Gym for an evening packed with bingo\, laughs\, and Halloween-themed
  excitement. Whether you are feeling lucky or just looking for a fun way 
 to spend the night with friends\, this event is open to all students and 
 is the perfect chance to enjoy campus spirit and make lasting memories. P
 lus\, the excitement does not stop there — the grand prize winner will re
 ceive Six Flags Fright Fest tickets! 🎢🎟️ Come ready to play\, win\, and
  celebrate the spooky season with us! 🕸️✨\nHow do I sign-up?\n\nNo regis
 tration required\nFREE for students with a valid Montclair State ID\n\nWh
