 tunities\nDeveloping industry connections and professional networks\nSkil
 ls that helped them succeed after graduation\nChallenges\, opportunities\
 , and lessons learned along the way\n\nFeatured career areas include:\n\n
 Performing Arts and Theater Production\nFashion and Apparel\nDance and Pe
 rformance\nArts Administration\nHuman Resources in Creative Industries\n\
 nStudents will have the opportunity to ask questions\, learn about differ
 ent career paths\, and gain firsthand insights from CART alumni who have 
 successfully launched their careers.\n\nHosted by: The Office for Experie
 ntial Education and Career Connections\n\nAdditional Information can be f
 ound at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12539112
