DESCRIPTION:Starting September 17th\, join the Champions and the OTWASS te
 am for our weekly study hall night hosted in CSS room 005! We'll have an 
 open space for individual work\, group work\, and even have a tutor avail
 able to assist with work on the spot! Every Thursday from 5-7\, whether C
 hampions or not\, feel free to join us for discussion\, connection\, stud
 ying\, and tutoring. \n\nHosted by: Bloomfield PBI-C CHAMPIONS Program\n\
